sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Backend Spring Boot
    participant AI as AI Service FastAPI
    participant M as Modelos

    B->>AI: POST /internal/v1/transactions/classify
    AI->>M: predict(text)
    M-->>AI: category, confidence
    AI-->>B: TransactionClassificationResult

    B->>AI: POST /internal/v1/profiles/analyze
    AI->>M: predict(features)
    M-->>AI: profile, score, confidence
    AI-->>B: ProfileAnalysisResult
